{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Even the developer can\u2019t score over 3,000. Who\u2019s up for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seoyugi Run: Wukong Run</strong> is an action runner set in a mystical Eastern fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong>Sun Wukong</strong> as you run, jump, and fight your way across endless platforms.<br>Behind the simple controls awaits thrilling double-jumps, attack combos, deadly obstacles, and intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet addictive running action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls with jump, double jump, and attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various obstacles such as spikes, enemies, and projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A powerful <strong>\u201cBurst Mode\u201d</strong> unleashed by filling the gauge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect coins to unlock items and skins for progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced action and challenging difficulty, this game offers the perfect endless runner experience for players who love excitement and competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035300?t=1762393758","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035300/701bb8c27de9165d835877a64a4507a4e8f7abbd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762393758","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035300/f90e75fad2356b7b72fd98fe5726ec761953a121/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762393758","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035300/f90e75fad2356b7b72fd98fe5726ec761953a121/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762393758","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Fam